flowchart LR
  User --> Browser[Next.js browser app]
  Browser -->|HTTPS/JSON + bearer token| API[FastAPI]
  API --> PG[(PostgreSQL)]
  API --> S3[(Private S3)]
  PG --> Worker[Polling worker]
  Worker --> S3
  Worker --> Parse[PyMuPDF / optional local Tesseract / rules]
  Parse --> PG
  PG --> Index[Chunk + local embedding stage]
  Index --> Qdrant[(Optional Qdrant)]
  API --> Retrieval[Owner-scoped retrieval]
  Retrieval --> PG
  Retrieval --> Qdrant
  Retrieval -->|authorized evidence| LLM[Optional Groq-compatible API]
  LLM --> API
